<title>NEW ZEALAND: FCL Group consolidated profit rises to NZ$490 mln.</title>
<headline>FCL Group consolidated profit rises to NZ$490 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   490 vs 464</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)			9.14 vs 8.49</p>
<p>    EBIT					   832 vs 943</p>
<p>    Pretax profit				676 vs 736</p>
<p>    Tax					    107 vs 137</p>
<p>    Minority interest		  debit 119 vs 154 debit</p>
<p>    Equity earnings			     40 vs 19</p>
<p>Balance sheet (in billions unless stated)</p>
<p>    Current assets			    2.69 vs 2.98</p>
<p>    Total assets			     13.35 vs 13.26</p>
<p>    Current liabilities		     2.15 vs 2.40</p>
<p>    Total liabilities			 6.73 vs 6.65</p>
<p>    Shareholders' equity		    6.61 vs 6.61</p>
<p>Cashflow from operating activities 1.299 vs 1.175</p>
<p>Cashflow from investing activities(1.10) vs (0.61)</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
